  "description": "Immaculate home in the desirable Ayr Hill Heights community. A welcoming foyer opens to formal living and dining rooms, and the family room showcases a fireplace. The gourmet kitchen features modern white cabinetry, quartz countertops, premium stainless appliances and an oversized center island. An office, mudroom and half bath complete the main level. Upstairs, the owner&rsquo;s suite is a private retreat with a sitting area, walk-in closet and en suite bath, joined by four additional bedrooms, two full baths and the laundry room. The finished lower level offers a recreation room, two bedrooms and a full bath. Outside, a large deck, fire pit, mature landscaping and an expansive level yard give you room to entertain and relax, while a welcoming front porch, two-car side-loading garage and driveway complete the picture.",
